        "faq_item_3": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Is this an ebook or a printed book?",
            "answer": "<p>An ebook. You get a PDF and an EPUB file by email straight after you pay, and you can read them on any phone, tablet, computer or e-reader.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_4": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the difference between the editions?",
            "answer": "<p>The ebook is the book. Ebook and audiobook adds the full audio, read by Maren. The complete set adds sixty printable care cards as well.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_5": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "A plant is dying right now. Where do I start?",
            "answer": "<p>Start with chapter twelve, what the leaves are telling you, then look up your plant in the care notes. Most rescues start with moving the pot or watering less.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_6": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Are these plants safe for pets?",
            "answer": "<p>Every plant in the care notes is marked safe or not safe for cats and dogs. For a full list, the short pet safe guide covers forty plants. If a pet has eaten a plant, call your vet.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_7": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I give it as a gift?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes. Add the recipient’s email at checkout and the files go to them with your note. For a plant shop or a group, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">write to us</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_item_8": {
          "type": "faq_item",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if it is not for me?",
            "answer": "<p>Email within 30 days and you get your money back. No questions asked.</p>"
          }
        }
